DESCRIPTION:A night built just for singles around laughter\, connection\, a
 nd just a little bit of awkward.\n\nWe are so excited to feature our good f
 riend Steve Soelberg\, known for his viral specials on PeacockTV\, Dry Bar\
 , Wiseguys\, and SiriusXM. Steve’s dry humor turns everyday moments into 
 stories that hit a little too close to home in the best way. He also wears 
 pants (sometimes)\, has his TSA CLEAR ready to go\, and is super confused b
 y lasers. All other details you’ll have to find out from Steve directly. 
 And ladies… He’s single.\n\nCome a little early for some mingling befor
 e the show and to grab a drink and order some food. We’ll have some sligh
 tly guided conversations\, a few seat rotations\, and some built-in shenani
 gans just for this singles crowd. After the show\, stick around to find tho
 se kindred connections who laughed at all the same jokes you did\, and mayb
 e grab a number or two.\n\nCome solo or bring a friend as your emotional su
 pport animal. Either way\, it’ll be a good time had by all. Oh\, and defi
 nitely make eye contact with Steve. He loves that.\n\nTickets are limited. 
 Grab yours and join us\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/eve
 nt/singles-at-wiseguys-w-steve-soelberg/
